When using Offboard plugin, I have noticed that the plugin is processing heartbeats coming from other components on the same system (Camera, Gimbal, ...).
My workaround is to filter Heartbeats mavlink message based on the message component ID, using default Autopilot value MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1.

I just added these lines at the beginning of the "process_heartbeat" function:
```
void OffboardImpl::process_heartbeat(const mavlink_message_t& message)
{
    // Process only Heartbeat coming from the autopilot
    if (message.compid != MAV_COMP_ID_AUTOPILOT1) {
        return;
    }
```

