@JonasVautherin I am learning about custom dialect and found your PR #1291. Thanks for that, it is a good starting point (and all the other messages about this subject too) and I gave it a try.

Using the PR as-is works as described. Now I would like to try it out with the current code and that does not work as expected. The instructions are working up until, and including, v0.37.0 and not for later versions. It is probably because of a different use of the api  (regarding the connections?) but since I am fresh on the subject I cannot judge that.

Is it possible that you check the instructions against the current version of MAVSDK? Thanks in advance!
